We are looking for a Social Media Marketing Manager to lead the planning and execution of social media strategies across multiple brands and platforms (e.g., Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, X, LinkedIn). This role covers the full funnel—from strategy development and content planning to daily operations, performance analysis, and paid media optimization. You will: Develop and implement social media strategies to grow brand presence, engagement, and follower base across platforms; Plan and manage content calendars, ensuring consistent and engaging brand communication for multiple brands; Collaborate with content creators, designers, and product teams to produce compelling visual and written content; Manage and optimize paid social campaigns (e.g., Meta Ads, TikTok Ads), track performance, and adjust based on data insights; Analyze key performance metrics (e.g., CPM, CTR, engagement rate, ROAS) and provide actionable insights; Stay up-to-date with social media trends, tools, and platform updates, and translate these into opportunities for growth; Coordinate with agencies or external partners when needed, while ensuring alignment with internal brand guidelines.

岗位要求:
2–5 years of hands-on experience in social media marketing or digital marketing roles; Proven experience in managing social accounts and paid ads across platforms like Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or LinkedIn; Strong understanding of content strategy, audience targeting, and social KPIs; Basic experience with paid media tools (e.g., Meta Business Suite, TikTok Ads Manager) is a strong plus; Good project management skills; able to handle multiple brands and campaigns at once; Comfortable working in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment;

